{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32588","headline":"过铸鼎原 · 刘沧","name":"过铸鼎原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄帝修真万国朝，鼎成龙驾上丹霄。\n天风乍起鹤声远，海雾渐深龙节遥。\n仙界日长青鸟度，御衣香散紫霞飘。\n唯留古迹寒原在，碧水苍苍空寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}